msgid "Ignore headings that match the following CSS selector(s). Classes should have \".\" before. Separate multiple headings by comma. Defaults to \".awb-exclude-from-toc, .awb-exclude-from-toc *\", which will ignore any title with \"awb-exclude-from-toc\" class, or any title inside a parent with same class."
